''' [[Waves]]''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the he [[Waves Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Ocean Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Summer Event 2023|2023 Summer Event]]. It is now only available through trading since the event has ended.

==Appearance==
This knife has curved waves, with the color combinations of pastel blue, and light blue, representing the waves of the ocean. The handle appears to be linen colored shells, with another tiny pint of light blue at the end, which seems to be a tiny wave

==Trivia==
*It has a partner gun under the name [[Ocean]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ocean_Set Ocean Set].
*This and its partner gun were the first summer themed godlies to be added to the game, the others being [[Pearl]], [[Pearlshine]], [[Watergun]], and [[Chroma Watergun]].
*This knife was released on July 4th, 2023, during the [[Summer Event 2023|2023 Summer Event]].
*This and its partner gun are the sixth gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].
*This knife was [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2’s]] icon for a period of time.
*This knife and its partner were replaced by [[Darksword]] and [[Darkshot]].

